t 22 [Construction Details 1]:** Construction details for curbs, sidewalks, driveways, and bicycle parking. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-22/guide.md`\n    35→- **Sheet 23 [Construction Details 2]:** Standard construction details for water infrastructure, valves, and fire hydrants. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-23/guide.md`\n    36→- **Sheet 24 [Construction Details 3]:** Standard construction details for water services and trench repairs. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-24/guide.md`\n    37→- **Sheet 25 [Construction Details 4]:** Standard details, plan, and section views for fire line meters. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-25/guide.md`\n    38→- **Sheet 26 [Construction Details 5]:** Standard details for wastewater service connections and sewer cleanouts. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-26/guide.md`\n    39→- **Sheet 27 [Construction Details 6]:** Construction details for wastewater manholes and duplex grinder pumps. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-27/guide.md`\n    40→- **Sheet 28 [Construction Details 7]:** Construction details for storm drain manholes and catch basins. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-28/guide.md`\n    41→- **Sheet 29 [Addressing Plan]:** Site plan showing building layouts and individual unit addresses. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-29/guide.md`\n    42→- **Sheet 30 [Existing Tree Plan]:** Site plan displaying existing trees, protection measures, and care notes. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-30/guide.md`\n    43→- **Sheet 31 [Landscape Plan]:** Landscape design plan featuring planting details and irrigation notes. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-31/guide.md`\n    44→- **Sheet 32 [Tree List]:** This page provides a detailed list of surveyed trees. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-32/guide.md`\n    45→- **Sheet 33 [Canopy Impact Exhibit]:** Exhibits detailing tree canopy calculations and construction impact analysis. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-33/guide.md`\n    46→- **Sheet 34 [Root Zone Impact Exhibit]:** Critical root zone impact diagrams, calculations, and tree photos. → `primary-site-plan/