{"level":30,"time":1778265074366,"pid":48914,"hostname":"Mac.lan","step":"review-runs","item":"1.md","index":3,"runIndex":"run-1","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01EcawkmjfDVm6qYF7M3f1Up","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"No building elevation sheets found in the primary site plan. The site plan set appears to be 39 sheets, and looking at the README, I see:\n- Sheet 1: Cover\n- Sheet 2: Plat\n- Sheet 3: General Notes\n- Sheet 4: Existing Conditions\n- Sheet 5-7: Erosion Control\n- Sheet 8: Tree Removal & Demolition\n- Sheet 9: Site Plan\n- Sheet 10: Fire Protection\n- Sheet 11: Grading\n- Sheet 12: Storm Sewer\n- Sheet 13-14: Drainage\n- Sheet 15-16: Biofiltration/Detention\n- Sheet 17: Conveyance Cross Sections\n- Sheet 18: Austin Water\n- Sheet 19: Utility Tap\n- Sheet 20: Utility Tap Profile\n- Sheet 21: Electrical Design\n- Sheet 22-28: Construction Details\n- Sheet 29: Addressing\n- Sheet 30: Existing Tree\n- Sheet 31: Landscape\n- Sheet 32: Tree List\n- Sheet 33-34: Tree Impact\n- Sheet 35: Landscape Calculations\n- Sheet 36: Biofiltration Planting\n- Sheet 37: Landscape Details\n- Sheet 38-39: Wall Plans\n\nThere are NO building elevation sheets in this set. The sheets include site plans, grading plans, utility plans, construction details, landscape plans, and wall plans - but NO building elevations showing the proposed buildings' exterior elevations and their relationship to overhead utilities.\n\nThis is significant because:\n1. EL-1.7 requires \"surveyed elevations and locations of overhead conductors...on building elevation sheets\"\n2. EL-1.8 requires \"section and plan view exhibits showing dimensions from outer conductor to outermost edge of buildings\"\n3. EL-1.3 requires showing building projections' clearances\n\n\nWithout building elevation sheets, I cannot verify these critical clearance requirements. The Wall Plans might contain cross-sections indicating clearances, so I should examine those. I also need to check whether the driveway and parking areas along Valley View Road maintain adequate clearance from the overhead lines visible in that area.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1731,"cache_read_input_tokens":58317,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1731},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e9306442-64b4-48d1-9fb6-43ef93edac6e","uuid":"67f2285a-2822-448b-8310-bb9b5ff3ed33"}
